        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS44U, 4\" x 4\" Heavy Duty Grade Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe package includes a pair (2) 4 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinges and matching finish Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws as well as #12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. The 4 x 4 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge is fitted with a removable, stainless steel pin. It utilizes a template screw hole pattern. The Deltana SS44U Hinge Set can be installed on wood or metal doors.  Available in Satin or Polished finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS44U-specifications.gif?v=1704354603\" width=\"557\" height=\"260\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS44U Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.129\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS44Ux-specification.pdf?v=1704262169\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS44U Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
